WEBVTT

00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:05.089
It appears that you're the last one.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.967
Damn it! You damn brats...
Who do you think you are?!

00:00:08.218 --> 00:00:09.177
Dust Cyclone!

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:10.386
Flamethrower!

00:00:10.637 --> 00:00:13.348
Combo Attack! Telekinetic Pillar of Flame!

00:00:13.598 --> 00:00:16.226
Don't underestimate me! This is nothing--

00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:20.813
Good job, you two.

00:00:21.064 --> 00:00:22.315
You've gotten stronger.

00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:24.442
We've been practicing every day.

00:00:24.692 --> 00:00:26.653
It's all thanks to your guidance, Teru-san.

00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:28.696
Thank you for helping us, Takeuchi-san.

00:00:28.947 --> 00:00:32.242
No need to thank me.
I left the organization as well.

00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:35.537
I acted like I betrayed you so we could
pull off a splendid surprise attack.

00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:40.375
You better be grateful for me
and my peerless wit.

00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:44.170
What? H-Huh? I can't move...

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.048
--Kaito-kun.
--Lie-Detection Telepathy!

00:00:48.216 --> 00:00:50.635
It's okay. He hasn't betrayed us yet.

00:00:50.885 --> 00:00:52.136
What do you mean, "yet"?!

00:00:52.387 --> 00:00:54.389
So what are we going to do now?

00:00:54.639 --> 00:00:57.475
Reigen-san said we didn't have to fight,

00:00:57.725 --> 00:00:59.894
but I disagree.

00:01:00.144 --> 00:01:02.146
We're going to take our city back.

00:01:06.609 --> 00:01:09.153
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:01:09.404 --> 00:01:11.990
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.867
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:01:15.118 --> 00:01:16.369
(Get ready!)

00:01:17.161 --> 00:01:21.624
Coming down,
could you fill your satisfaction?

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:27.130
You're a MOB.
Can't you feel your own frustration?

00:01:28.506 --> 00:01:32.885
Coming down,
could you fill your satisfaction?

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:37.015
You're a MOB.
What do you want to be?

00:01:37.265 --> 00:01:43.980
Wear your overflowing emotions
on your sleeve and break it down

00:01:45.815 --> 00:01:49.110
What do you see once you go
beyond your limits?

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:52.030
(99.9! 99.9)

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:55.199
The mysterious percentage

00:01:56.909 --> 00:01:59.370
Cr yin' my life, or yin' my psyche,

00:01:59.621 --> 00:02:02.373
Cr yin' my heart in such commonplaces!

00:02:02.624 --> 00:02:05.209
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind?

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:08.046
It all begins when it hits 100

00:02:08.296 --> 00:02:10.882
The MOB is alive. The MOB is high.

00:02:11.132 --> 00:02:13.760
The MOB is staying frustrated, aren't you?

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:18.097
Is that your ideal?
Is that your mind? Right now

00:02:19.557 --> 00:02:20.683
YOUR LIFE IS YOUR OWN.

00:02:20.933 --> 00:02:23.269
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:23.269 --> 00:02:23.394
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:23.394 --> 00:02:23.645
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:02:23.645 --> 00:02:26.230
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:26.481
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:02:26.481 --> 00:02:27.815
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:27.815 --> 00:02:29.150
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.652
(Get ready!)

00:02:33.029 --> 00:02:37.116
"Guidance
- Psychic Sensor~"

00:02:38.076 --> 00:02:39.452
You pathetic dogs...

00:02:39.702 --> 00:02:46.334
You've forgotten how terrifying your owner
can be because I left you alone for a bit.

00:02:46.584 --> 00:02:47.919
Sho is here.

00:02:49.087 --> 00:02:49.837
Okay, let's go.

00:02:50.088 --> 00:02:51.172
Say, Ritsu.

00:02:51.422 --> 00:02:54.384
Why are you being so cooperative?

00:02:55.426 --> 00:02:59.305
Because your situation wasn't
completely unrelatable.

00:02:59.555 --> 00:03:04.977
There are times when I worry what'd happen
if Nii-san went berserk with his powers.

00:03:05.228 --> 00:03:08.439
And Suzuki, your father is
going berserk right now.

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:11.192
You're the only one who can stop him.

00:03:11.442 --> 00:03:15.405
Yeah! I'll show you that I can finish this!

00:03:16.698 --> 00:03:19.409
There you are, Shimazaki!

00:03:19.659 --> 00:03:21.285
I can tell at a glance...

00:03:21.536 --> 00:03:23.496
He's really strong!

00:03:23.746 --> 00:03:26.082
He's a teleporter that can
read his enemy's movements.

00:03:26.332 --> 00:03:28.292
--First, I'll--
--You go on ahead.

00:03:28.543 --> 00:03:30.461
I'll keep him occupied.

00:03:30.712 --> 00:03:32.505
You can't deal with him alone.

00:03:32.755 --> 00:03:34.632
He's one of the strongest
in the whole organization.

00:03:34.882 --> 00:03:36.092
And that's exactly why.

00:03:36.342 --> 00:03:40.430
In return, promise me that
you'll stop your father.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.933
I promise. I'm glad to have you around.

00:03:44.183 --> 00:03:45.143
Go!

00:03:58.197 --> 00:03:59.365
He got away?

00:04:10.543 --> 00:04:12.086
He doesn't intend to follow Suzuki?

00:04:12.336 --> 00:04:13.755
I'm over here.

00:04:15.131 --> 00:04:18.509
I'd appreciate it if you
wouldn't resist so much.

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:21.304
I don't exactly like beating on weaklings.

00:04:21.554 --> 00:04:23.848
You're just as weak!

00:04:24.891 --> 00:04:28.686
Oh? And who are you comparing me to?

00:04:33.941 --> 00:04:36.861
I should've taken him out
before it got to this point.

00:04:37.111 --> 00:04:40.698
I'd just been powerless to do anything
but sit back and watch...

00:04:40.948 --> 00:04:42.074
This is it for you.

00:04:42.325 --> 00:04:44.869
Such a shame. You managed to get this far...

00:04:45.119 --> 00:04:46.454
But now, you have to deal with me.

00:04:46.704 --> 00:04:48.748
My dad is using his powers for evil,

00:04:48.998 --> 00:04:51.918
but I'm going to use my powers
to show him what's right!

00:04:53.628 --> 00:04:55.296
I'm going to end this!

00:04:57.256 --> 00:05:00.426
How awful. Someone used
psychic powers to do this?

00:05:00.676 --> 00:05:02.595
That's the enemy base.

00:05:02.845 --> 00:05:04.764
Reigen and the others should
be heading over, too.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:09.560
Hey, there's still some brat here.
Did he wait too long to run away?

00:05:09.811 --> 00:05:11.354
Whoo! Got us some dinner.

00:05:11.604 --> 00:05:13.022
So they're pillaging the area.

00:05:13.272 --> 00:05:15.733
I've gone there with Ritsu before.

00:05:15.983 --> 00:05:18.319
Return what you took from the store.
Stealing is a crime.

00:05:18.569 --> 00:05:19.487
You're supposed to be adults.

00:05:19.737 --> 00:05:21.239
Who the hell are you?

00:05:23.991 --> 00:05:27.286
This town belongs to us now.

00:05:27.537 --> 00:05:29.789
Yo, stop. You're gonna traumatize him.

00:05:30.039 --> 00:05:32.333
Stop messing around with your powers.

00:05:32.583 --> 00:05:34.377
Don't use them like this.

00:05:34.627 --> 00:05:35.795
Stop.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:41.175
I-Is this kid a natural esper?

00:05:41.425 --> 00:05:44.762
Could you guys manufacture this can?

00:05:45.012 --> 00:05:45.847
Huh?

00:05:46.097 --> 00:05:49.642
Could you actually grow
the vegetables in this sandwich?

00:05:49.892 --> 00:05:53.896
Could you fix that glass door you just broke?

00:05:54.146 --> 00:05:58.192
Could your powers help you hit upon the idea
of giving out a freebie for a lucky draw?

00:05:58.442 --> 00:05:59.819
The hell are you trying to say?

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:03.114
You guys are making a huge mistake,

00:06:03.364 --> 00:06:06.659
thinking you're special
just because of your powers.

00:06:06.909 --> 00:06:10.872
You should realize that you're only able to
survive thanks to the help of others.

00:06:11.122 --> 00:06:15.001
You fool! You can make anyone submit
to you as long as you have power!

00:06:15.251 --> 00:06:19.297
One last thing... Don't use your
physic powers against others.

00:06:19.547 --> 00:06:22.133
If you don't have anyone
who can give you that advice,

00:06:22.383 --> 00:06:23.593
I'll do it.

00:06:26.429 --> 00:06:29.390
Holy crap, he's pissed. I'm gonna get back.

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:30.516
An attack by the enemy?

00:06:30.766 --> 00:06:32.351
Gather everyone up!

00:06:32.602 --> 00:06:33.686
Well, well...

00:06:33.936 --> 00:06:36.856
Looks like we had quite the stray show up.

00:06:37.106 --> 00:06:38.441
Minegishi-san!

00:06:38.691 --> 00:06:41.319
I'll take him down.
You guys back me up.

00:06:45.323 --> 00:06:49.702
These will grow as much as I'd like
if I give them my power...

00:06:51.329 --> 00:06:54.373
...and multiply as much as I'd like.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.922
You can do it, too?

00:07:01.172 --> 00:07:04.508
You don't really like plants, do you?

00:07:04.759 --> 00:07:07.345
That's right. They're merely tools.

00:07:10.598 --> 00:07:12.266
Go! Drop him!

00:07:13.601 --> 00:07:14.894
Help Minegishi-san out!

00:07:15.144 --> 00:07:16.938
Hit him with your telekinesis!

00:07:21.025 --> 00:07:23.653
It's better to bend than break.

00:07:23.903 --> 00:07:26.030
You should join our side.

00:07:28.366 --> 00:07:32.912
That might be easier, but it's no fun.

00:07:34.664 --> 00:07:37.083
You should see the difference
in our abilities by now.

00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:41.504
You sure you won't change your mind
if I hurt you a bit more?

00:07:42.546 --> 00:07:45.591
I always wanted to be able
to use psychic powers.

00:07:45.841 --> 00:07:50.012
But now that I've finally awakened to
these powers, I finally understand...

00:07:50.262 --> 00:07:55.351
To shed blood, sweat, and tears
in order to live a fun life...

00:07:55.601 --> 00:08:00.272
What I really wanted was
that kind of wholehearted devotion.

00:08:01.357 --> 00:08:05.236
I won't let anyone take away
my ability to live a fun life!

00:08:05.486 --> 00:08:08.447
Guess you might not be a good fit, after all.

00:08:08.698 --> 00:08:10.533
In that case, I'll just...

00:08:14.453 --> 00:08:15.538
Ow...

00:08:15.788 --> 00:08:18.082
I managed to land a hit for the first time!

00:08:18.332 --> 00:08:20.793
My, my, you're far more
resilient than I'd imagined.

00:08:21.043 --> 00:08:23.421
We need to repay you for
what you did earlier.

00:08:23.671 --> 00:08:26.799
I guess you're not sewer rats.
You're cockroaches.

00:08:27.049 --> 00:08:28.926
We've changed since we were in Claw.

00:08:29.176 --> 00:08:33.264
Now that we want independence,
we're far more resilient.

00:08:33.514 --> 00:08:35.725
The results won't change,
no matter how many times you try.

00:08:35.975 --> 00:08:38.728
Don't act so tough.
We know you're panicking.

00:08:38.978 --> 00:08:40.229
Even if you can read our moves,

00:08:40.479 --> 00:08:43.190
you should hit your limit
with so many people.

00:08:43.441 --> 00:08:45.317
I'll be getting my revenge!

00:08:48.571 --> 00:08:50.031
Takeuchi!

00:08:54.201 --> 00:08:55.161
Tsuchiya!

00:08:59.415 --> 00:09:01.459
Not happening!

00:09:10.718 --> 00:09:12.303
Aren't you going to shoot?

00:09:21.187 --> 00:09:23.856
I don't think capture tactics
will be of much use.

00:09:28.944 --> 00:09:30.154
I told you...

00:09:30.154 --> 00:09:30.404
"Cleaning"”

00:09:30.404 --> 00:09:32.615
"Cleaning"” The result won't change,
no matter how many of you there are.

00:09:32.615 --> 00:09:32.656
"Cleaning"”

00:09:39.622 --> 00:09:41.373
Attack more! The more moves we make,

00:09:41.624 --> 00:09:43.918
we can figure out where
he'll teleport and finish him!

00:09:49.298 --> 00:09:51.342
They're far more capable than
those people in the division...

00:09:51.592 --> 00:09:53.636
Don't stop, Shigeo!

00:09:53.886 --> 00:09:56.931
All right! He's panicking!
Let's hit him some more!

00:09:59.683 --> 00:10:01.352
Looks like you're having some trouble.

00:10:01.602 --> 00:10:02.436
You're...

00:10:02.686 --> 00:10:05.314
I wouldn't mind lending you my support.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.400
Now, go!

00:10:10.194 --> 00:10:11.654
It's Matsuo, the evil-spirit user!

00:10:11.904 --> 00:10:14.281
He's gonna send all kinds of monsters at us!

00:10:17.243 --> 00:10:19.578
I'd appreciate it if you
wouldn't underestimate me...

00:10:21.038 --> 00:10:22.206
Matsuo-san!

00:10:24.083 --> 00:10:25.876
What's this small bottle?

00:10:26.127 --> 00:10:27.586
Talk about bad taste.

00:10:27.837 --> 00:10:29.880
N-No, anything but that!

00:10:30.131 --> 00:10:32.842
Even I can't control it! Don't touch it!

00:10:33.092 --> 00:10:37.096
You dumb-ass! We have Minegishi-san!

00:10:41.016 --> 00:10:43.686
Wh-What? Why's everyone falling...

00:10:46.939 --> 00:10:49.608
What... is that?

00:10:49.859 --> 00:10:51.485
Mogami-san!

00:10:51.735 --> 00:10:53.112
This isn't good.

00:10:53.362 --> 00:10:54.697
What is that?

00:10:57.158 --> 00:11:01.996
So, after the poison jar, you now want me
to devour a horde of espers...

00:11:02.246 --> 00:11:04.498
You're such lowly creatures...

00:11:06.834 --> 00:11:10.379
Wh-What the hell is that?!

00:11:12.965 --> 00:11:15.259
My plants aren't listening to me!

00:11:20.306 --> 00:11:21.974
"Winner"

00:11:24.059 --> 00:11:25.728
[ ] Wi [ ]

00:11:31.483 --> 00:11:32.902
Stop!

00:11:33.152 --> 00:11:34.486
Why are you trying to stop me?

00:11:34.737 --> 00:11:38.115
I've been watching, and none of
these insects deserve to live.

00:11:38.365 --> 00:11:41.118
There are humans that never change.

00:11:41.368 --> 00:11:43.621
But... they might be able to change!

00:11:43.871 --> 00:11:46.332
Promise that you won't do
anything bad ever again!

00:11:46.582 --> 00:11:49.543
I promise... Spare me...

00:11:49.793 --> 00:11:50.544
See?!

00:11:50.794 --> 00:11:53.881
What if he's just lying so he can survive?

00:11:54.131 --> 00:11:58.552
Are you going to watch over them
until they've reformed?

00:11:58.802 --> 00:12:01.305
You think you can keep
an eye on them forever?

00:12:01.555 --> 00:12:04.767
Well... no.

00:12:05.017 --> 00:12:08.520
But we need to have faith in one another
in order to get through life.

00:12:08.771 --> 00:12:12.983
If we can't do that,
we'll never get anywhere.

00:12:13.234 --> 00:12:15.611
I'd expect nothing less from you.

00:12:15.861 --> 00:12:19.782
But there are things that can't
be solved with mere kindness.

00:12:20.032 --> 00:12:23.535
It's also necessary to be
hard on people at times.

00:12:23.786 --> 00:12:28.832
If you can do that, you will be invincible,
Kageyama Shigeo-kun.

00:12:32.169 --> 00:12:35.965
Did Mogami disappear
for good this time, or...?

00:12:36.215 --> 00:12:38.467
Be hard on people, huh?

00:12:39.802 --> 00:12:41.220
I'm not very good at that.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:46.016
I'm here now. Claw is finished!

00:12:46.267 --> 00:12:49.520
Sho, there must've been
a better way of doing this.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:50.938
We're family.

00:12:51.188 --> 00:12:53.440
What? Now you want to act like a father?

00:12:53.691 --> 00:12:56.360
You never cared about a damn thing I said.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:13:00.072
You should've attacked while
playing the obedient son.

00:13:01.115 --> 00:13:03.325
Don't get in my way any further.

00:13:03.575 --> 00:13:05.703
It took me 20 years to get here.

00:13:05.953 --> 00:13:09.623
Serves you right!
I've ruined those 20 years for you!

00:13:09.873 --> 00:13:12.835
I'm just as strong as the Ultimate 5 now!

00:13:13.085 --> 00:13:14.878
Fight me, man to man!

00:13:16.088 --> 00:13:17.464
Don't make me laugh.

00:13:17.715 --> 00:13:19.800
Never look down on your father.

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.886
A stupidly powerful barrier that
activates when I try to get close...

00:13:23.137 --> 00:13:25.472
Is that your true power?

00:13:25.723 --> 00:13:26.765
In that case...

00:13:34.148 --> 00:13:36.233
Damn it... He's mocking me!

00:13:37.901 --> 00:13:40.195
These techniques are mere child's play.

00:13:41.655 --> 00:13:45.117
I thought you would've grown
a little more than that.

00:13:47.202 --> 00:13:51.206
Oh? You've learned how to mess with
the refraction factor of light?

00:13:51.457 --> 00:13:53.334
This is my trump card!

00:13:53.584 --> 00:13:55.544
Here's the energy I've saved up
over three months...

00:13:55.794 --> 00:13:57.838
Charge Bomb!

00:14:00.883 --> 00:14:03.218
Hell, yeah! Justice prevails!

00:14:06.722 --> 00:14:09.683
I'm so sorry. I wouldn't have taken a
bathroom break if I'd known this'd happen.

00:14:09.933 --> 00:14:10.809
That's fine.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.437
My son's just going through
his rebellious phase.

00:14:13.687 --> 00:14:15.272
Being a bad boy again?

00:14:15.522 --> 00:14:17.691
You'll never turn out to be
a decent adult like that.

00:14:17.941 --> 00:14:21.236
Screw you! That was three
months' worth of energy!

00:14:21.487 --> 00:14:25.199
Let's stop fighting and happily
take over the world together.

00:14:25.449 --> 00:14:27.034
Don't bother.

00:14:27.284 --> 00:14:30.454
I can see why Sho would disagree with this.

00:14:30.704 --> 00:14:35.542
You fear this plan will fail, don't you?
You don't know the outside world, after all.

00:14:35.793 --> 00:14:38.587
The real reason I went around the world

00:14:38.837 --> 00:14:43.050
was to see if world domination
would actually be realistic.

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:48.180
But ultimately, I couldn't find a single
esper stronger than me in this world.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:52.142
I have the ultimate power.

00:14:52.393 --> 00:14:55.646
And that gives you the right
to take over the world?

00:14:55.896 --> 00:14:59.858
Did you hear that, Serizawa?
He's totally messed up in the head.

00:15:00.109 --> 00:15:01.527
President...

00:15:01.777 --> 00:15:03.487
You're so cool.

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.573
Absolute idiots are the worst to deal with!

00:15:06.824 --> 00:15:09.118
I'm impressed with your attack earlier.

00:15:09.368 --> 00:15:11.370
The apple really doesn't
fall far from the tree.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:13.580
Don't lump me in with you!
How am I anything like you?!

00:15:13.831 --> 00:15:16.375
You said you were charging up
energy for three months?

00:15:16.625 --> 00:15:19.128
I have the same ability.

00:15:19.378 --> 00:15:21.380
--What?!
--Didn't I tell you?

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:25.384
I spent 20 years preparing for this.

00:15:25.634 --> 00:15:29.763
Don't tell me that the last 20 years
wasn't to gather all those troops...

00:15:30.013 --> 00:15:33.767
I guess it wouldn't hurt to show you
some of my 20 years...

00:15:36.019 --> 00:15:38.313
Why not give up already,

00:15:38.564 --> 00:15:41.608
you poor souls the boss named the Scars?

00:15:41.859 --> 00:15:42.860
Shut it!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:47.489
You're a goddamn coward that doesn't
have the guts to go against the boss!

00:15:47.739 --> 00:15:51.785
The real reason he named you "Scars"
is because you're all failures.

00:15:52.035 --> 00:15:55.539
You were marked as damaged goods!

00:15:55.789 --> 00:15:56.915
Screw you!

00:15:57.166 --> 00:15:58.876
Telekinetic Helix!

00:16:00.669 --> 00:16:04.131
As for the basics required of espers...

00:16:04.381 --> 00:16:07.134
...we're on a entirely different level.

00:16:10.846 --> 00:16:13.015
I'm saying this for your own good.

00:16:13.265 --> 00:16:15.142
You should just give up.

00:16:19.396 --> 00:16:23.317
But that manhole cover had
some effect, didn't it?

00:16:25.819 --> 00:16:26.445
Teru-san!

00:16:26.695 --> 00:16:30.491
Yeah. It looks like attacks he didn't
detect actually worked against him.

00:16:30.741 --> 00:16:34.244
He's the one who's been cornered here.

00:16:35.621 --> 00:16:37.623
You're quite efficient.

00:16:37.873 --> 00:16:38.874
Because of that...

00:16:41.293 --> 00:16:45.130
...I'll get rid of you first, once and for all.

00:17:00.312 --> 00:17:02.064
Not good. He's going to destroy him.

00:17:02.314 --> 00:17:03.774
What can we do?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:17.371
I believe it's time to end things.

00:17:17.621 --> 00:17:18.997
Next, you'll come from behind!

00:17:19.248 --> 00:17:19.873
You--

00:17:20.123 --> 00:17:23.252
It might be convenient to be able
to read your opponents' moves,

00:17:23.502 --> 00:17:25.879
but that also makes your moves monotonous.

00:17:26.129 --> 00:17:27.965
You rely too much on your powers.

00:17:30.217 --> 00:17:31.635
Well, this is surprising.

00:17:31.885 --> 00:17:35.847
If we disregard the boss, I do have
the position as the world's greatest.

00:17:37.474 --> 00:17:42.437
There are people in this world
with powers you can't even fathom.

00:17:42.688 --> 00:17:47.150
You're just an ordinary man.
Even I could defeat you.

00:17:47.401 --> 00:17:48.360
Why y--

00:17:48.944 --> 00:17:50.821
You're right! It's when he's distracted!

00:17:51.071 --> 00:17:53.198
Nice, Little Bro!

00:17:55.534 --> 00:17:57.244
Fifth Punch!

00:17:57.494 --> 00:17:59.746
Super Destructive Energy Blast!

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:11.800
I-I need to regain my...

00:18:18.056 --> 00:18:20.559
C-Concentrate...

00:18:20.809 --> 00:18:23.770
Concentrate. Concentrate and you'll
be able to figure everything out.

00:18:24.021 --> 00:18:28.233
Everyone here is an esper.
Cut everything else out.

00:18:28.483 --> 00:18:31.361
Concentrate. Concentrate.

00:18:31.612 --> 00:18:33.405
Mind's Eye!

00:18:46.918 --> 00:18:50.297
Nothing you can do will
ever work on me again.

00:18:50.547 --> 00:18:53.550
Your injuries, the weaknesses
even you're not aware of,

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:55.510
and the fact that you can barely see now...

00:18:55.761 --> 00:18:58.138
I can see through everything now.

00:18:58.388 --> 00:19:00.682
It's too late to have any regrets.

00:19:05.812 --> 00:19:06.605
What's the matter?

00:19:06.855 --> 00:19:12.486
Something with tremendous
energy is heading this way.

00:19:12.736 --> 00:19:15.155
Pretty sure that's my friend.

00:19:15.405 --> 00:19:16.907
I guess you finally woke up,

00:19:17.157 --> 00:19:18.575
Kageyama-kun.

00:19:22.329 --> 00:19:23.830
How amusing.

00:19:24.081 --> 00:19:28.835
Let's see whose abilities are greater!

00:19:29.086 --> 00:19:31.088
I'll face you head-on!

00:19:31.338 --> 00:19:33.757
Self-Defense Rush!

00:19:34.007 --> 00:19:34.299
One of Reigen's special moves where,

00:19:34.299 --> 00:19:36.843
"Self-Defense Rush"
One of Reigen's special moves where,

00:19:36.843 --> 00:19:37.094
"Self-Defense Rush"

00:19:37.094 --> 00:19:41.682
"Self-Defense Rush" when he's unsure if it's really
self-defense, he yells out "self-defense" just in case.

00:19:41.682 --> 00:19:41.890
When he's unsure if it's really self-defense,
he yells out "self-defense" just in case.

00:19:43.934 --> 00:19:46.687
Impossible! I couldn't sense him at all.

00:19:46.937 --> 00:19:48.563
Who is he?!

00:19:48.814 --> 00:19:49.648
Reigen-san!

00:19:49.898 --> 00:19:52.901
Everyone, get up! The great master is here.

00:19:53.151 --> 00:19:55.445
The great master? Don't tell me...

00:19:55.696 --> 00:19:59.574
There's an esper who can actually
make his presence disappear?

00:19:59.825 --> 00:20:02.160
What should I do? Should I withdraw?

00:20:02.411 --> 00:20:05.122
Master, he's rather strong.

00:20:05.372 --> 00:20:07.207
He's dangerous, so please step back.

00:20:07.457 --> 00:20:10.877
--Oh, hey, Mob.
--That boy from earlier and this unknown esper...

00:20:11.128 --> 00:20:12.546
Just how many are there?

00:20:12.796 --> 00:20:14.881
Do they have some kind of huge organization?

00:20:15.132 --> 00:20:18.218
More importantly, this kid...
is on a whole other level.

00:20:20.637 --> 00:20:24.891
Yeah, I give up. I don't stand a chance. I give.

00:20:25.142 --> 00:20:26.727
Well, that was easy.

00:20:26.977 --> 00:20:29.104
What happened to taking over the world?

00:20:29.354 --> 00:20:31.481
The only one serious about that is the boss.

00:20:31.732 --> 00:20:34.192
I don't really care
as long as I get to have fun.

00:20:34.443 --> 00:20:36.361
As long as you get to have fun?

00:20:37.529 --> 00:20:40.449
You disrupted the lives of
so many people just for that?

00:20:40.699 --> 00:20:42.075
You can't be serious.

00:20:44.786 --> 00:20:46.037
He ran away!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.457
I don't feel like we won at all.

00:20:48.707 --> 00:20:50.542
He might attack again.

00:20:50.792 --> 00:20:53.545
No, I'm pretty sure he's been traumatized.

00:20:53.795 --> 00:20:58.300
I think he might've learned his place
and turned over a new leaf.

00:20:58.550 --> 00:20:59.801
Nii-san.

00:21:00.051 --> 00:21:02.095
Ritsu! Are you okay?

00:21:02.345 --> 00:21:05.724
Yeah. Mom and Dad are somewhere safe, too.

00:21:05.974 --> 00:21:08.977
I see. So it's just like
Dimple and Master said.

00:21:09.227 --> 00:21:11.229
We sure had one hell of a scare.

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:12.981
Shut up.

00:21:13.231 --> 00:21:16.109
Now, then... I guess all we
have left is the last boss.

00:21:16.359 --> 00:21:19.112
Hoshino-kun and the others should be
getting people to safety right about now.

00:21:19.362 --> 00:21:21.531
Let's meet back up with them and attack.

00:21:21.782 --> 00:21:23.241
No.

00:21:23.492 --> 00:21:25.327
You're all hurt.

00:21:25.577 --> 00:21:27.204
I'll go alone.

00:21:27.454 --> 00:21:30.582
K-Kageyama-kun! What are you talking about?!

00:21:30.832 --> 00:21:33.710
I'll go, too! One of my
friends already went in!

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.337
No.

00:21:35.587 --> 00:21:38.715
This might be hard to hear,
but you'll just be in my way.

00:21:38.965 --> 00:21:40.091
I'm sorry.

00:21:40.342 --> 00:21:42.010
"Being hard on people"...

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:46.556
So this is how Shigeo processed
what Mogami said to him.

00:21:46.807 --> 00:21:48.475
Dimple, I'm counting on you.

00:21:48.725 --> 00:21:50.185
I know!

00:22:04.908 --> 00:22:10.205
I spilled a seed and lost sight of it

00:22:13.834 --> 00:22:18.713
I'll find it using the color it's dyed in
and watch it grow

00:22:21.424 --> 00:22:27.097
It immediately returned
to the palm of my hand

00:22:27.347 --> 00:22:36.439
But it's still too light and too frail
to reach for the skies

00:22:37.983 --> 00:22:42.279
The world coldly drains away all the heat

00:22:42.529 --> 00:22:46.867
The bright sunshine just isn't enough

00:22:47.117 --> 00:22:51.371
The memories are closing off what lies ahead

00:22:51.621 --> 00:22:56.793
Shake off their warmth
and set off into the distance

00:22:58.044 --> 00:23:03.300
If I let it wither, it'd be over just like that

00:23:03.550 --> 00:23:08.471
But my hope just doesn't fade away

00:23:25.155 --> 00:23:27.324
You're not scared to do this on your own?

00:23:27.574 --> 00:23:28.533
Of course I'm scared.

00:23:28.783 --> 00:23:32.329
But having someone else get hurt
scares me even more.

00:23:32.579 --> 00:23:34.623
I'm sure I'll be able
to figure something out.

00:23:34.873 --> 00:23:38.251
Crap... I'm trying to take advantage
of him while he's still a kid,

00:23:38.501 --> 00:23:42.047
but Shigeo's going to become
an adult before I know it.

00:23:43.965 --> 00:23:48.511
Are you in middle school?
Damn... You're still a kid.

00:23:48.762 --> 00:23:51.514
This is a really bad time.

00:23:51.765 --> 00:23:54.225
Would you kindly leave?

00:23:55.852 --> 00:23:57.437
Mob finally infiltrates the enemy's base.

00:23:57.687 --> 00:24:00.023
Can he get past Serizawa
and make it to the boss?

00:24:00.273 --> 00:24:03.234
Meanwhile, the boss, who just defeated
his son, Sho, shows his true identity.

00:24:03.485 --> 00:24:05.320
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 Il Episode 12:

00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:06.988
"The Battle for Social Rehabilitation
- Friendship~."

00:24:07.238 --> 00:24:09.950
"The Battle for Social Rehabilitation - Friendship~" The
serious option C involves Blu-rays, manga volumes, and events!

00:24:09.950 --> 00:24:10.116
